title: "Agentic RAG Knowledge Assistant"
abstract: >-
  A retrieval-augmented assistant where an agent plans its own tool calls over
  hybrid BM25 and vector retrieval, a knowledge graph, web search, and a
  structured catalog, streams a cited answer, and verifies every claim against
  its sources.
